# Keep the compact audited summaries and row-level result tables in Git. The
# remaining run artifacts include trained models and per-flow particle arrays
# and can be regenerated with the experiment runner.
*
!.gitignore
!severity_paper_summary/
!severity_paper_summary/**
!severity_paper_seed0/
!severity_paper_seed0/results.csv
!severity_paper_seed1/
!severity_paper_seed1/results.csv
!severity_paper_seed2/
!severity_paper_seed2/results.csv

